@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"

Feature: WWW Request A Demo
	Frontend testing for the www request a demo page

Scenario: View Request A Demo Page
	End users should be able to view the request a demo page and form.

	Given I go to the www page with the relative url "request-a-demo"
	Then I should be able to view the Request a Demo page and form
	Given I go to the www homepage
	And I click on the Request a Live Demo button
	Then I should be able to view the Request a Demo page and form
	Given I go to the www homepage
	And I click on the footer "Request a Demo" link under the "Platform" footer category
	Then I should be able to view the Request a Demo page and form

Scenario: Request a demo via request a live demo button
	End users should be able to fill and submit the request a demo form via request a live demo button.

	Given I go to the www homepage
	And I click on the Request a Live Demo button
	And I should be able to view the Request a Demo page and form
	And I request a demo with the following values
	| Work Email                         | usr.requestdemo1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Country                            | United States                          |
	| State/Territory                    | California                             |
	| Whats your challenge?              | Increasing B2B online revenue          |
	| First Name                         | USR                                    |
	| Last Name                          | RequestDemo1                           |
	| Company                            | Redemo                                 |
	| Phone                              | 555-555-5678                           |
	| Industry                           | Technology                             |
	And I wait for "5" seconds
	Then I should be able to view a thanks message stating that they will contact soon and the demo was requested
	And the current url content should contain the text "request-a-demo/thank-you"

Scenario: Request a demo via request a demo footer link
	End users should be able to fill and submit the request a demo form via request a demo footer link.

	Given I go to the www homepage
	And I click on the footer "Request a Demo" link under the "Platform" footer category
	And I should be able to view the Request a Demo page and form
	And I request a demo with the following values
	| Work Email                         | usr.requestdemo1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| Country                            | United States                          |
	| State/Territory                    | California                             |
	| Whats your challenge?              | Increasing B2B online revenue          |
	| First Name                         | USR                                    |
	| Last Name                          | RequestDemo1                           |
	| Company                            | Redemo                                 |
	| Phone                              | 555-555-5678                           |
	| Industry                           | Technology                             |
	And I wait for "5" seconds
	Then I should be able to view a thanks message stating that they will contact soon and the demo was requested
	And the current url content should contain the text "request-a-demo/thank-you"